{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the gorilla.<br>They are the 100 men.<br>Only one side walks away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Showdown: Gorilla vs. 100</strong> is a chaotic, over-the-top <i>roguelike/roguelite</i> brawler where you take on wave after wave of determined (but mostly doomed) human opponents. With physics-driven ragdoll mayhem, every punch, throw, and slam is uniquely hilarious and brutally satisfying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde0 Why fight 100 men?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because the internet won't stop arguing about it.<br>Because science won't answer the question.<br>Because you're a gorilla\u2014and gorillas don't need a reason.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca5 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100 men. No mercy.</strong> Face a growing variety of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brutal ragdoll physics.</strong> Every hit is a spectacle thanks to dynamic animations and weighty combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike progression.</strong> Every run is different\u2014unlock gorilla upgrades, new abilities, and arena modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill meets silliness.</strong> Easy to pick up, hard to master, and always hilarious to watch.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720170?t=1751474613","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720170?t=1751474613","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720170/a5c00625e80c3b56e6ea31d38ab246ab6e97da48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751474613","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720170/a5c00625e80c3b56e6ea31d38ab246ab6e97da48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751474613","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dookie added plus much more!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720170/extras/dookie.png?t=1751474613\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I think it was a much needed addition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo dev here trying my best to finish this game while trying to balance work and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Added a lot of great updates to my game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience progression system</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience pickup orbs</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Item unlock system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New enemy type (thrower)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Updated enemy types</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tanks now stomp and cause ground eruption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bomber explosions</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">UI sound and animations tweaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Settings added</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hoping to release in the upcoming few weeks. Hope everyone enjoys and <strong>if this interests you,</strong> <strong>Wishlist is available.</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the gorilla.<br>They are the 100 men.<br>Only one side walks away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Showdown: Gorilla vs. 100</strong> is a chaotic, over-the-top <i>roguelike/roguelite</i> brawler where you take on wave after wave of determined (but mostly doomed) human opponents. With physics-driven ragdoll mayhem, every punch, throw, and slam is uniquely hilarious and brutally satisfying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde0 Why fight 100 men?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because the internet won't stop arguing about it.<br>Because science won't answer the question.<br>Because you're a gorilla\u2014and gorillas don't need a reason.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca5 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100 men. No mercy.</strong> Face a growing variety of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brutal ragdoll physics.</strong> Every hit is a spectacle thanks to dynamic animations and weighty combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike progression.</strong> Every run is different\u2014unlock gorilla upgrades, new abilities, and arena modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill meets silliness.</strong> Easy to pick up, hard to master, and always hilarious to watch.</p></li></ul>","developers":["FancyRancy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720170/b32433817f70abe69cb23bb6072c1826127a5b6a/header.jpg?t=1751474613","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257164368,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164368/movie480.mp4?t=1751474609","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164368/movie_max.mp4?t=1751474609"},"name":"The Showdown: Gorilla vs 100 Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257164368/46ed4646eebcad0db96ea768f7a91c909c548f10/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751474609","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164368/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751474609","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164368/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751474609"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257158601,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158601/movie480.mp4?t=175147